title: Start
---
<<declare $Goblin = "Goblin">>
<<declare $Lady = "Lady">>
<<declare $Soldier = "Soldier">>
<<declare $Wiki = "Wiki">>
<<declare $Hiki = "You">>

<<set $Goblin = GetPartDisplayName("Goblin")>>
<<set $Wiki = GetPartDisplayName("Wiki")>>
<<set $Soldier = GetPartDisplayName("Soldier")>>
<<set $Lady = GetPartDisplayName("Lady")>>
<<set $Hiki = GetPartDisplayName("Hiki")>>

{$Soldier}: Oh God, how long were we out?
//<<wait  3.0>>
{$Wiki}: Judging by the clock, we were blissfully asleep for three hours.
//<<wait  3.0>>
{$Soldier}: Three hours? Over a text? Disgraceful.
//<<wait  3.0>>
{$Soldier}: Alright, family roll-call.
//<<wait 5.0>>
{$Lady}:  I'm here!
//<<wait  3.0>>
{$Wiki}: Presence affirmative.
//<<wait  2.0>>
{$Goblin}: Begrudgingly here.
//<<wait  2.0>>
{$Hiki}: Here!
//<<wait  4.0>>
{$Goblin}: Who the fuck are you?
//<<wait  3.0>>
{$Soldier}: Just what we needed... Goblin, show them the ropes. Get this place spruced up.
//<<wait  3.0>>
{$Goblin}: Aye-aye, captain dickhead.
<<unlock_icon "Floor">>
===